Spec: OwnedFrpSession

Purpose:
  Own one private FRP child and its files through partial startup and repeated cleanup.

Owns:
  ./OwnedFrpSession.cs

References:
  ./FrpRuntimeBridge.sdd

Must:
  Register bridge ownership before child start, abort owned networking/processes on stop, and reject late startup after stop.
  Dispose only known owned profile/log files, including empty logs; refuse linked or out-of-root cleanup paths and permit cleanup retry.
